# Database Schema Draft

## Entity: Project

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| name | String | Project name |
| description | Text | Project description |
| status | Enum | Planned, Active, On Hold, Completed |
| health | Enum | Green, Yellow, Red |
| startDate | Date | Optional |
| targetDate | Date | Optional |
| createdAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |
| updatedAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |

## Entity: Risk

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| projectId | UUID | Foreign key to Project |
| title | String | Risk title |
| description | Text | Risk details |
| probability | Enum | Low, Medium, High |
| impact | Enum | Low, Medium, High |
| severity | Enum | Low, Medium, High |
| owner | String | Risk owner |
| mitigationPlan | Text | Mitigation details |
| status | Enum | Open, Monitoring, Mitigated, Closed |
| createdAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |
| updatedAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |

## Entity: Blocker

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| projectId | UUID | Foreign key to Project |
| title | String | Blocker title |
| description | Text | Blocker details |
| owner | String | Blocker owner |
| status | Enum | Open, In Progress, Resolved |
| createdAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |
| updatedAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |

## Entity: Milestone

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| projectId | UUID | Foreign key to Project |
| name | String | Milestone name |
| targetDate | Date | Milestone target date |
| status | Enum | Not Started, In Progress, Completed, Delayed |
| createdAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |
| updatedAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |

## Entity: StatusReport

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary key |
| projectId | UUID | Foreign key to Project |
| summary | Text | Weekly summary |
| accomplishments | Text | Completed work |
| risksSummary | Text | Risk overview |
| blockersSummary | Text | Blocker overview |
| nextSteps | Text | Upcoming actions |
| createdAt | DateTime | Auto-generated |
